---
import Legal from "../layouts/Legal.astro";
---

<Legal title="Privacy Policy">
  <p class="updated">Last updated: {new Date().getFullYear()}</p>

  <p>
    <strong>Short version:</strong> rxova.org is a static website. It doesn't collect
    your personal data, set cookies, or track you.
  </p>

  <h2>What is collected</h2>
  <p>
    Nothing directly. There are no accounts, no analytics, no tracking pixels, and no
    advertising on this site, and it does not set cookies.
  </p>

  <h2>Hosting logs</h2>
  <p>
    rxova.org is served by GitHub Pages. As with any website, the host may process
    standard request metadata (such as your IP address and browser user-agent) in order
    to deliver pages and protect the service. That processing is governed by
    <a
      href="https://docs.github.com/en/site-policy/privacy-policies/github-general-privacy-statement"
      target="_blank"
      rel="noopener noreferrer">GitHub's Privacy Statement</a
    >, not by this site.
  </p>

  <h2>External links</h2>
  <p>
    Pages here link out to other services — npm, GitHub, and each project's
    documentation. Once you follow a link, that destination's own privacy policy applies.
  </p>

  <h2>Changes</h2>
  <p>If this policy changes, the updated version will be posted on this page.</p>

  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>
    Questions? <a href="mailto:rxova@proton.me">rxova@proton.me</a>.
  </p>
</Legal>
